  m: ["Oestrus is not ovulation: in the cow the ovulation is after the end of oestrus. Pregnancy is possible without any visible oestrus signs in silent heat cows."],
  sa: [["What hormone causes the LH surge?", "Oestrogen from the mature follicle by positive feedback."], ["Name two induced ovulators.", "Cat and rabbit."], ["Which hormone causes luteolysis?", "Prostaglandin F2 alpha from the uterus."]],
